el**\nThe game can stay open alongside other apps and experiences. Whether you are taking a break, filling a few spare minutes, or just want something relaxing running in the background.\n\n# **Traditional Solitaire, in VR!**\nThe game includes all the features you would expect from a modern Solitaire experience, including multiple scoring modes, draw 1 or draw 3 options, daily games, hints, undo, and auto-complete for completed wins. Customize your experience with different backgrounds and settings to match how you like to play.\n\n# **Designed specifically as a VR Panel App**\nSolitaire \u2013 VR Panel lets you enjoy a timeless card game without pulling you away from whatever else you are doing in Quest. Play at your own pace, your own way, while keeping other content within reach!", "short_description": "Solitaire - VR Panel brings classic Solitaire to Meta Quest in a lightweight panel you can play alongside anything else. Enjoy familiar options like multiple scoring modes, draw 1 or 3, daily games, customizable backgrounds, and more. Perfect for a quick round while multitasking in VR!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://petricoregames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://petricoregames.com/tos/", "publisher_name": "Petricore", "support_website_url": "https://petricoregames.com/#contact", "website_url": "https://petricoregames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_mod